UnitAerodromeMigration::RenounceOwnership
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when the migration is not paused
│   └── it should revert with ExpectedPause
└── when the migration is paused
    ├── when the remaining TOKEN balance is not zero
    │   └── it should revert with RemainingBalance
    └── when the remaining TOKEN balance is zero
        ├── it should renounce ownership
        └── it should emit OwnershipTransferred
